      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "贰流餐馆之所以只是二星级，\n是因为火力不足。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
