      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA369125E865178FF01001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但如果只是随处都有的那种辣，\n真正的辣党是不会满足的！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n毕竟他们的意见也会很毒辣。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
