      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，我想请你帮忙！\n请你把名字叫做<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>狠辣椒<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的宝可梦<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n带来我们餐厅吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
