      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621151FA6C574E862026202651FA6C574E8620262026000A51FA6C574E862026202651FA6C574E86202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我确认一下\n这个辣度是否值得一试。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA96211786E8BA44E004E0B000A8FD94E2A8FA35EA6662F5426503C5F974E008BD530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "尽管来吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3D7BA167655427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这精华里充满刺激的味道\n会提高我的攻击力！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD97CBE534E91CC51456EE1523A6FC0768454739053000A4F1A63D09AD862117684653B51FB529BFF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "直击脑顶啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76F451FB81119876554AFF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这种辣……真是不得了！\n它点燃了我内心的火焰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD979CD8FA320262026771F662F4E0D5F974E86FF01000A5B8370B971C34E86621151855FC37684706B7130300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯嗯……\n有辣味的卡娜莉面包也不错。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF55EF20262026000A67098FA35473768453615A1C8389976253054E5F4E0D9519300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿8",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "与家人一起享受\n充满刺激的美食！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0E5BB64EBA4E008D774EAB53D7000A51456EE1523A6FC076847F8E98DFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我明明不喜欢辣……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211660E660E4E0D559C6B228FA3202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "刺激就是最棒的！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "523A6FC05C31662F670068D27684FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "居然搞辣度大比拼，\n这个庆典真让人好奇！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C457136641E8FA35EA659276BD462FCFF0C000A8FD94E2A5E865178771F8BA94EBA597D5947FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这真是不得了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9771F662F4E0D5F974E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太刺激了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A523A6FC04E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎哟！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE54DFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太棒了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A68D24E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "极品之辣♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "678154C14E4B8FA3266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿B",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托你啦，狠辣椒。\n给我狠狠地撒上精华吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584F605566FF0C72E08FA369123002000A7ED9621172E072E0573064924E0A7CBE534E542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣的东西\n会给我带来幸福。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA376844E1C897F000A4F1A7ED962115E2667655E78798F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太辣的话，\n会痛的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A8FA376848BDDFF0C000A4F1A75DB768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "快来满足我这个\n辣度鉴定师吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FEB67656EE18DB362118FD94E2A000A8FA35EA692745B9A5E08542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "微辣♪微辣♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FAE8FA3266A5FAE8FA3266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "狠辣椒！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72E08FA36912FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "厉害啊，狠辣椒。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 3480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53895BB3554AFF0C72E08FA3691230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这味道辣得\n我仿佛置身天堂！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9547390538FA35F97000A62114EFF4F5B7F6E8EAB59295802FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣倒还好，主要是痛！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 3532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA350128FD8597DFF0C4E3B8981662F75DBFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "隐约带点果香。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96907EA65E2670B9679C999930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇喔！\n我感到一股神秘的活力。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C75594FF01000A6211611F52304E0080A1795E79D876846D3B529B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿N",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 3604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF004E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把辣椒精华\n撒遍我的全身吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A8FA369127CBE534E000A6492904D6211768451688EAB5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣椒精华！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 3648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA369127CBE534EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在初次体验\n如此恐怖的辣度！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 3660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B635728521D6B214F539A8C000A59826B646050601676848FA35EA6FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿R",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 3696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00520000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的胃是铁做的，\n不管多辣都不在话下！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 3708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768480C3662F94C1505A7684FF0C000A4E0D7BA1591A8FA390FD4E0D57288BDD4E0BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不太喜欢辣的东西。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 3748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D592A559C6B228FA376844E1C897F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣椒精华进我眼睛里了！\n真不愧是凶暴的狠辣椒啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 3772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA369127CBE534E8FDB6211773C775B91CC4E86FF01000A771F4E0D6127662F51F666B4768472E08FA36912554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "胃里翻江倒海。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80C391CC7FFB6C5F50126D7730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘶～明明辣得不行，\n但我的嘴却停不下来。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 3840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5636FF5E660E660E8FA35F974E0D884CFF0C000A4F466211768456345374505C4E0D4E0B676530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿X",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 3884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00580000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请给我超辣♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77ED962118D858FA3266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来啦！来啦！来啦！它来啦！\n来啦！它来啦！辣椒精华！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 3912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655566FF0167655566FF0167655566FF015B8367655566FF01000A67655566FF015B8367655566FF018FA369127CBE534EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦～？是甜的。\n跟我期待的不太一样啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 3968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF5EFF1F662F751C76843002000A8DDF6211671F5F8576844E0D592A4E006837554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\\",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 4008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF005C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣椒庆典！\n能成为密阿雷的特产吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 4020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA369125E865178FF01000A80FD62104E3A5BC6963F96F7768472794EA75417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是害我失望，\n这家店就只配拿一星！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 94,
      "offsetInSection": 4056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F5BB362115931671BFF0C000A8FD95BB65E975C3153EA914D62FF4E00661FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多么热情的招式！\n辣椒指数突破上限！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 95,
      "offsetInSection": 4096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A4E4870ED60C5768462DB5F0FFF01000A8FA36912630765707A8178344E0A9650FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣得直冲脑顶。\n辣椒庆典真是顶呱呱。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 96,
      "offsetInSection": 4136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA35F9776F451B2811198763002000A8FA369125E865178771F662F98765471547130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这家贰流餐馆\n升到三星的日子也不远了吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 97,
      "offsetInSection": 4176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD95BB68D306D4199109986000A534752304E09661F768465E55B504E5F4E0D8FDC4E86542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿b",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 98,
      "offsetInSection": 4220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我肚子比较脆弱，\n但也想挑战一下。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 99,
      "offsetInSection": 4232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71366211809A5B506BD48F8381065F31FF0C000A4F464E5F60F3631162184E004E0B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我光是看着辣椒精华那像是\n在燃烧的颜色，肚子就会痛！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 100,
      "offsetInSection": 4272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115149662F770B77408FA369127CBE534E90A350CF662F000A572871C370E77684989C8272FF0C809A5B505C314F1A75DBFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这辣味真是一绝，\n不过感觉得在厕所蹲一阵子了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 101,
      "offsetInSection": 4328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD98FA35473771F662F4E007EDDFF0C000A4E0D8FC7611F89C95F975728539562408E724E0096355B504E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿f",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 102,
      "offsetInSection": 4376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "狠辣椒……\n有点吓人，不是我的菜。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 103,
      "offsetInSection": 4388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72E08FA3691220262026000A670970B954134EBAFF0C4E0D662F6211768483DC30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我对狠辣椒的香味\n很感兴趣。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 104,
      "offsetInSection": 4424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BF972E08FA36912768499995473000A5F88611F51748DA330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "香味好浓啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 105,
      "offsetInSection": 4456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "99995473597D6D53554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我都要喜欢上狠辣椒了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
