      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣椒精华已经撒遍\n所有桌上的菜品了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
